  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.1.0 adds source positions and styled spans, Unicode text-element analysis, immutable rich-text layout, caret and selection geometry, retained text presentation, prepared-cell bulk writes, large-content viewport geometry, and stateless fixed/weighted track layout with capped distribution. Bounded opt-in refresh diagnostics record explicit outcomes. Public-only roguelike and editor samples exercise large synthetic content and application-owned navigation. The package preserves the 2.0 assembly version and its sole direct Icod.Terminal 1.18.0 dependency.",
